<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="zh-Hant"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="27853830"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1529120971"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Sister,Friend,Lover"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="松来未佑 / 柚木凉香"/><amll:meta key="album" value="邪礼曲たち"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:27.534"><div begin="00:20.698" end="03:27.674"><p begin="00:20.698" end="00:22.885" itunes:key="L8123">你的微笑總在你的face</p><p begin="00:22.895" end="00:25.447" itunes:key="L8124">讓我捨不得自私的runaway</p><p begin="00:25.510" end="00:27.915" itunes:key="L8125">我不要你 難道還會要誰</p><p begin="00:28.000" end="00:30.579" itunes:key="L8126">別人靠近我 我都無所謂</p><p begin="00:30.589" end="00:33.020" itunes:key="L8127">你所有的感受 我通通都懂<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然唐突 虽然冒昧</span></p><p begin="00:33.112" end="00:35.470" itunes:key="L8128">給你更多感動 你不會退貨</p><p begin="00:35.656" end="00:37.989" itunes:key="L8129">耐心的陪伴 讓你不會上火<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我现在还爱着那个孩子</span></p><p begin="00:38.218" end="00:40.892" itunes:key="L8130">目標明確 你是我的夢<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狂风中</span></p><p begin="00:41.069" end="00:43.571" itunes:key="L8131">就想黏著 喜歡跟你趴趴走</p><p begin="00:43.742" end="00:46.110" itunes:key="L8132">飛到紐約 我們一起逛Soho<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凝视着你</span></p><p begin="00:46.196" end="00:48.601" itunes:key="L8133">燭光晚餐 我們一起吃個夠</p><p begin="00:48.681" end="00:51.168" itunes:key="L8134">就算鐵心腸 也能夠溫柔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就是非常开心 心情高涨</span></p><p begin="00:51.178" end="00:53.048" itunes:key="L8135">就享受大器 不計較小氣<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可爱会扰乱</span></p><p begin="00:53.058" end="00:55.553" itunes:key="L8136">就算不知道你秘密 我也不會在意</p><p begin="00:55.563" end="00:58.228" itunes:key="L8137">認識你需要多麽多麽多麽好的運氣<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的秩序</span></p><p begin="00:58.326" end="01:02.196" itunes:key="L8138">感謝老天安排 能夠和你這樣走在一起<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姐妹 朋友 爱人</span></p><p begin="01:02.280" end="01:04.381" itunes:key="L8139">Uhh 但你總是在那懷疑我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论何时我都伴你左右</span></p><p begin="01:04.391" end="01:06.917" itunes:key="L8140">說我又唸我 每天在那嫌我朋友多<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要轻易说不需要</span></p><p begin="01:06.927" end="01:09.397" itunes:key="L8141">這個朋友不能見 那個朋友有風險</p><p begin="01:09.451" end="01:11.969" itunes:key="L8142">是否對前任留戀 為何ig留了言<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受我吧 想要成为</span></p><p begin="01:12.063" end="01:14.664" itunes:key="L8143">Uhh 時間它會證明一切的<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姐妹 朋友 爱人</span></p><p begin="01:14.674" end="01:17.217" itunes:key="L8144">Uhh 別在那疑神疑鬼的 Now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满足你们所有的需求</span></p><p begin="01:17.227" end="01:21.930" itunes:key="L8145">Uhh 我很喜歡你的一切 但有時想狠狠碎唸 Aye</p><p begin="01:21.940" end="01:26.304" itunes:key="L8146">我對你的愛大不同</p><p begin="01:26.515" end="01:28.818" itunes:key="L8147">我對你有愛又恨</p><p begin="01:28.939" end="01:32.278" itunes:key="L8148">我對你有愛又恨</p><p begin="01:32.393" end="01:36.553" itunes:key="L8149">給你的愛加倍多</p><p begin="01:36.680" end="01:39.078" itunes:key="L8150">有多愛就有點恨</p><p begin="01:39.084" end="01:42.358" itunes:key="L8151">有多愛就有點恨</p><p begin="01:42.916" end="01:45.075" itunes:key="L8152">Oh 你的訊息 總是讓我驚喜</p><p begin="01:45.101" end="01:49.028" itunes:key="L8153">多麽可愛貼心 貼圖帶著比心 Yea</p><p begin="01:48.074" end="01:49.879" itunes:key="L8154">緊貼你的身旁 毫無距離<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢谁的心情</span></p><p begin="01:50.067" end="01:52.433" itunes:key="L8155">每次牽起你的手 感覺毫無畏懼</p><p begin="01:52.619" end="01:54.984" itunes:key="L8156">讓我奉上我的熱情加上一點刺激<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要被历史所束缚</span></p><p begin="01:55.061" end="01:57.559" itunes:key="L8157">喜歡你對我的提醒要我處處小心<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次摇起马尾</span></p><p begin="01:57.639" end="02:00.156" itunes:key="L8158">雖然我的個性作為讓你常不滿意<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恋爱之心便不断增加</span></p><p begin="02:00.245" end="02:03.373" itunes:key="L8159">我的叛逆任性背後都是只願為你 Yea</p><p begin="02:03.484" end="02:05.693" itunes:key="L8160">Uhh 我不懂訊息為何又是他</p><p begin="02:05.703" end="02:08.156" itunes:key="L8161">半夜電話響起一堆朋友約你出去趴<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会变成爱情</span></p><p begin="02:08.166" end="02:10.739" itunes:key="L8162">難道平時假扮乖巧可愛都是在作假<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姐妹 朋友 爱人</span></p><p begin="02:10.804" end="02:13.314" itunes:key="L8163">問你幾個問題就要氣嘟嘟得要吵架<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会陪你到天涯海角</span></p><p begin="02:13.324" end="02:15.974" itunes:key="L8164">Uhh 我相信時間它會解答一切</p><p begin="02:15.984" end="02:18.467" itunes:key="L8165">Uhh 一起不容易繼續走起<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃跑 躲藏</span></p><p begin="02:18.477" end="02:23.698" itunes:key="L8166">Uhh 我很喜歡你的一切 但有時想狠狠碎唸 Aye</p><p begin="02:23.351" end="02:27.350" itunes:key="L12262">我對你的愛大不同<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姐妹 朋友 爱人</span></p><p begin="02:27.700" end="02:30.017" itunes:key="L12263">我對你有愛又恨</p><p begin="02:30.252" end="02:33.497" itunes:key="L12264">我對你有愛又恨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们会成为完美关系</span></p><p begin="02:33.747" end="02:37.752" itunes:key="L12265">給你的愛加倍多</p><p begin="02:37.943" end="02:40.225" itunes:key="L12266">有多愛就有點恨</p><p begin="02:40.523" end="02:43.740" itunes:key="L12267">有多愛就有點恨</p><p begin="02:43.116" end="02:46.074" itunes:key="L46901">Come on, just throw your hands in the air</p><p begin="02:46.290" end="02:48.661" itunes:key="L47016">Wave 'em like you just don't care</p><p begin="02:48.888" end="02:51.035" itunes:key="L47191">Just throw your hands in the air</p><p begin="02:51.386" end="02:53.605" itunes:key="L47310">Wave 'em like you just don't care</p><p begin="02:54.029" end="02:56.302" itunes:key="L47431">Just throw your hands in the air</p><p begin="02:56.490" end="02:58.773" itunes:key="L47554">Wave 'em like you just don't care</p><p begin="02:58.949" end="03:01.435" itunes:key="L47679">Just throw your hands in the air</p><p begin="03:01.653" end="03:03.899" itunes:key="L47806">Wave 'em like you just don't care</p><p begin="03:06.882" end="03:10.875" itunes:key="L12968">我對你的愛大不同<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姐妹 朋友 爱人</span></p><p begin="03:11.101" end="03:14.424" itunes:key="L12969">我對你有愛又恨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论何时我都伴你左右</span></p><p begin="03:13.922" end="03:17.251" itunes:key="L12970">我對你有愛又恨 Nah, baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要轻易说不需要</span></p><p begin="03:17.272" end="03:21.030" itunes:key="L12971">給你的愛加倍多<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受我吧  想要成为</span></p><p begin="03:21.371" end="03:23.689" itunes:key="L12972">有多愛就有點恨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">姐妹 朋友 爱人</span></p><p begin="03:23.856" end="03:27.674" itunes:key="L12973">有多愛就有點恨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满足你们所有的需求</span></p></div></body></tt>